            "source_entity_type": "Source",
            "relation": "PRODUCES_VARIABLE",
            "target_entity_instance": "diffuse sky radiation",
            "target_entity_type": "Variable",
            "paragraph": "A large amount of quality data is available from the Baseline Surface Radiation Network (BSRN) for the period from 1992 to present. This short but very important period for detecting changes compensates for the missing data for a number of sites in WRDC. In addition, the BSRN data are usually of the highest quality, and offer direct and diffuse sky radiation with auxiliary meteorological data observed at the same sites.",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
